<title>UK: Capital &amp; Regional sees record profits.</title>
<headline>Capital &amp; Regional sees record profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 25, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 12.21		 vs   8.85</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   2.0		  vs   n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   3.0		  vs   2.5</p>
<p> Pretax			 6.1		  vs   4.7</p>
<p> Net assets/shr (pence) 229.6		  vs 186.5</p>
<p> Shareholders funds     104.7		  vs  84.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per share on a net basis. Net assets per share fully diluted were 223.1 pence for 1996. Rental income net of property costs and administrative expenses was 11.65 million stg versus 6.01 million.</p>
<p>Full company name - Capital &amp; Regional Properties Plc</p>
</text>
